.TH RIG 1 "September 15, 2026" "Rig 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&
.PP
rig \- configure and orchestrate machine-bootstrap targets
.SH SYNOPSIS
\&
.B rig
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&
.PP
Rig coordinates package and configuration systems while leaving each target
responsible for its native manifests, resolution, and state.
.PP
The current repository scaffold exposes path discovery and completion
generation.
Profile and target orchestration are tracked as pending work.
.SH COMMANDS
\&
.TP
.B paths
Print the resolved Rig configuration, data, state, and cache directories.
.TP
.BI "completion " bash|zsh
Print completion source for the selected shell.
.TP
.B help
Show command help.
.SH OPTIONS
\&
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Show command help.
.TP
.BR \-V , " \-\-version"
Print the Rig version.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
\&
.TP
.B RIG_CONFIG_HOME
Override the Rig configuration directory.
.TP
.B RIG_DATA_HOME
Override the Rig data directory.
.TP
.B RIG_STATE_HOME
Override the Rig state directory.
.TP
.B RIG_CACHE_HOME
Override the Rig cache directory.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Set the base configuration directory when RIG_CONFIG_HOME is unset.
The fallback is $HOME/.config.
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Set the base data directory when RIG_DATA_HOME is unset.
The fallback is $HOME/.local/share.
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Set the base state directory when RIG_STATE_HOME is unset.
The fallback is $HOME/.local/state.
.TP
.B XDG_CACHE_HOME
Set the base cache directory when RIG_CACHE_HOME is unset.
The fallback is $HOME/.cache.
.SH FILES
\&
.TP
.I ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/rig
Default configuration directory.
.TP
.I ${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/rig
Default data directory.
.TP
.I ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/rig
Default state directory.
.TP
.I ${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/rig
Default cache directory.
.SH EXIT STATUS
\&
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Operational failure.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid Rig command syntax.
.SH SEE ALSO
\&
.BR bash (1),
.BR brew (1),
.BR chezmoi (1),
.BR uv (1)
